+# Discount codes on orders
+
+Spring campaign: an order can take one discount code.
+
+- `SPRING10`: 10 % off the order's items, rounded to the nearest cent (half cent up).
+- `WELCOME5`: 5.00 € off the items, only when items come to 30.00 € or more.
+- One code per order; a second replaces the first.
+- Unknown code, or `WELCOME5` on a smaller order: refused with an error saying why; order unchanged.
+- Shipping is never discounted; free shipping is decided on items before any discount.
+- API: `OrderBook.applyCode(orderNumber, code)`; `OrderTotals.discountCents` (0 without a code);
+  `totalCents` = items - discount + shipping.
